\cb3 Hannah Raymond-Cox (she/her) is a narrative designer, voice actor, and all-around word nerd. Clients include the BBC, the Economist, IO Interactive, and Epic Games; games include Spy of the Year (a jubensha), Totally Stab Caesar (a browser game), Bridge Command 1 (interactive immersive space adventures), and many many many gamified\'a0training mobile games. In her free time she makes ever-larger cups of loose-leaf tea.}